BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:google-play/target-api-2026-existing
DTSTAMP:20261118T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260831
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:Google Play: Existing apps must target API 35 to stay available to 
 new users
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Existing apps must target Android 15 (API level 3
 5) or higher to remain available to new users on devices running Android O
 S higher than your app's target API level.\nWho: Android phone and tablet 
 apps already published on Google Play (Wear OS needs API 34\, Android TV A
 PI 33\, Android XR API 34\, Android Automotive OS API 32)\nExtension until
  2026-11-01: On request in Play Console\nLast verified 2026-11-18
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/google-play/target-api-2026-exist
 ing/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Google Play: Existing apps must target API 35 to stay available
  to new users: in 30 days
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Google Play: Existing apps must target API 35 to stay available
  to new users: in 7 days
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
