DTSTAMP:20261118T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260831
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:Google Play: New apps and updates must target API 36
DESCRIPTION:What happens: New apps and app updates must target Android 16 (
 API level 36) or higher to be submitted to Google Play.\nWho: Android phon
 e and tablet apps published on Google Play (Wear OS and Android Automotive
  OS need API 35\, Android TV and Android XR need API 34)\nExtension until 
 2026-11-01: On request in Play Console\nLast verified 2026-11-18
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/google-play/target-api-2026-updat
 es/
